n generator's lookup, expanded\"\nCAF5,2040,A6N01SS-T5,Clear coating (anodize + clear paint),S1,p.529-530 type table,labelled,\"one row per (type, profile): the Python generator's lookup, expanded\"\nCAF5,4040,A6N01SS-T5,Clear coating (anodize + clear paint),S1,p.529-530 type table,labelled,\"one row per (type, profile): the Python generator's lookup, expanded\"\nHFSY5,2020,A6N01SS-T5,Baked paint (yellow),S1,p.529-530 type table,labelled,\"one row per (type, profile): the Python generator's lookup, expanded\"\nHFS6,3030,A6N01SS-T5,Clear anodize,S10,p.571 type table,labelled,\"one row per (type, profile): the Python generator's lookup, expanded\"\nHFSB6,3030,A6N01SS-T5,Black anodize,S10,p.571 type table,labelled,\"one row per (type, profile): the Python generator's lookup, expanded\"\nCAF6,3030,A6N01SS-T5,Clear coating (anodize + clear paint),S10,p.571 type table,labelled,\"one row per (type, profile): the Python generator's lookup, expanded\"\nHFSY6,3030,A6N01SS-T5,Baked paint (yellow),S10,p.571 type table,labelled,\"one row per (type, profile): the Python generator's lookup, expanded\"\n"
